    kind: invariant  # 2f48
    title: "cpp: methods defined in the body of a class declared with a qualified name (class OnlineStream::Impl { }) are registered bare, so a member forward binds to the method itself"  # 2f48
    status: violated  # 2f48
    priority: 2  # 2f48
    parent:  # 2f48
    tags:  # 2f48
    - cpp  # 2f48
